flowchart TD
Input --> TFIDF --> Category
TFIDF --> Sentiment
TFIDF --> Priority
Input --> Safety{Safety rule?}
Safety -- yes --> Critical[CRITICAL / SAFETY_RULE]
Safety -- no --> Priority
Category & Sentiment & Priority --> Confidence{Below 0.75?}
Confidence -- yes --> Review[Human review]
Confidence -- no --> Store[Store prediction]
Critical --> Review
Review --> Store
Store --> Override[Authorised human override]
